From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jens Willmer <info@jwillmer.de>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 15:34:44 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 093/110] Selected text in the preview keeps its colours and
 stays readable

The selection was filled in the full accent colour and only plain text
was recoloured, so links vanished and inline code and syntax colours
were hard to read on it. As in the editor, the selection is now a light
fill behind the text, which keeps its own colours.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

